.TH KTX_INFO 1 "2026-10-27" "ktx (Rust port)" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ktx_info \- print information about a KTX file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ktx
info [OPTION...] <input\-file>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the header, level index, data format descriptor, key/value data and supercompression
data of a KTX1 or KTX2 file. KTX2 files are also validated.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-f, \-\-format <format>
text, json or mini\-json (KTX1: text only).
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
ktx info \-\-format json tex.ktx2
.fi
.SH NOTES
This is an unofficial Rust port of Khronos KTX\-Software (libktx and the ktx CLI); it is not
the Khronos build of the tool. The complete, current option list is printed by
.B ktx info \-\-help.
.SH SEE ALSO
ktx(1)
